# Project NoéMI - clients/ directory
#
# Purpose
# -------
# This directory holds provisioned client configurations consumed by the
# `Client Onboarding` agent and downstream operations personas. The actual
# client subdirectories contain runtime/tenant state (credentials, per-client
# overrides, signed handshake artifacts) and must NEVER be committed to the
# reference architecture.
#
# This `.gitignore` keeps the directory tracked (so persona specifications
# that reference `clients/` resolve to a real path) while excluding the
# tenant state itself.
#
# Decision reference: docs/DECISION_LOG.md → [2026-05-28-0002]

# Ignore everything in this directory...
*
# ...except this file (so the directory stays tracked).
!.gitignore
